The h2.0 launch needed to feel unfamiliar enough to invite curiosity while
remaining immediately legible as a consumer product. The visual system uses
soft color, bold scale, and ample space to strike that balance.

= From shelf to screen

We designed the identity to work consistently across packaging, retail
displays, social media, and a responsive product story.
